# --- Learner profile: personal, never committed ---------------------------
# The real profile lives outside the plugin (~/.claude/learner-profile.md or
# ./.claude/learner-profile.md) so plugin updates cannot overwrite it.
# Only the empty example ships with the repo.
learner-profile.md
**/learner-profile.md
!templates/learner-profile.example.md

# --- Generated learning material: personal, not code ----------------------
# These patterns matter when someone uses a git repo as their study workspace.
# Courses, logs and retros are the learner's own notes, not source.
*_plan.md
*_learn.md
*_log.md
retro/
**/anki/
!docs/*_plan.md

# --- Where mistakes, ideas and tries pile up ------------------------------
# Scratch by definition: half-formed, often wrong, sometimes embarrassing.
# It is working material for one person, not something anyone should review,
# and error logs in particular record exactly where that person is weak.
errors/
**/errors/
mistakes/
**/mistakes/
ideas/
**/ideas/
drafts/
**/drafts/
scratch/
**/scratch/
sandbox/
**/sandbox/
experiments/
**/experiments/
playground/
**/playground/
tmp/
**/tmp/
*.scratch.*
*.draft.*
*.tmp

# --- OS / editor ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
